# After a trial that faulted: the bootloader has booted the trial
# once, so it boots slot A, release 1; the update PD finds the trial slot
# not running, unmarks it and says the update failed its trial; the
# rollback index stays 3.
NOWAYOS: supervisor: starting; children update_storage (0), update (1) and update_bundles (2)
NOWAYOS: update-bundles: starting
NOWAYOS: update-bundles: this image is release 1
NOWAYOS: update-bundles: the disk handed to the storage stand-in: 1736 bytes
NOWAYOS: update-bundles: no bundles and no health check this run
NOWAYOS: update-storage: starting
NOWAYOS: update-storage: the disk the last run left: booted slot A
NOWAYOS: update-storage: copy A on the disk: generation 3: slot A boots; slot B marked for one trial, security version 5; rollback index 3; trust list v2
NOWAYOS: update-storage: copy B on the disk: generation 2: slot A boots; nothing marked; rollback index 3; trust list v2
NOWAYOS: update: starting
NOWAYOS: update-storage: copy B written: generation 4: slot A boots; nothing marked; rollback index 3; trust list v2
NOWAYOS: update: starting: slot A boots; trial: none; rollback index 3; trust list v2 (held, checked against the anchors)
NOWAYOS: update: slot A runs, from the good slot: the update failed its trial, which is unmarked; 1 trust anchor(s) in the image

# Output that fails the run at once if it appears anywhere.
!MON|ERROR
!seL4(CPU
!panicked
!gave up
!not taken
!: does not decode
!refused
